# Credentials: one file per name, knowledge/credentials/<name>.env, with KEY=VALUE lines. They are not in git.
# A skill names the files it needs in its front matter (`credentials: [telegram]`); a role, a poller source or a
# channel may name more. A session gets the variables of the files of its skills, role or source.
#
# knowledge/credentials/vahtovik.env holds vahtovik's own secrets; vahtovik loads it at startup, and values
# already set in the environment win:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...          # only for `claude.auth: api-key` in vahtovik.yaml
#
# knowledge/credentials/telegram.env, for the telegram skill:
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456:ABC-your-bot-token
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=-1001234567890
